            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188426?u=5029ae346892ad6d2e3893c29edeeb8efff623b0&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds some missing Bun compatibility data for:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">File()</code> constructor: Bun 1.0.0</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">PerformanceResourceTiming</code>: Bun 1.1.37</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">PerformanceResourceTiming.toJSON()</code>: Bun 1.1.37</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">WebAssembly.JSTag</code>: Bun 1.2.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I checked support with Docker builds of Bun releases, working backward from the latest until support stopped.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
