            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF153 implements the new popover hint specification in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2029974\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2029974</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This version_removes the old implementation of the global <code class=\"notranslate\">hint</code> attribute (that has the note about the old spec) and adds a new release version for the global attribute. This also updates <code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLElement.hint</code>, which was omitted in the update in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4445048076\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29676\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29676/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29676\">#29676</a> (probably by accident).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note, this was not in the BCD collector run <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4700011374\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29883\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29883/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29883\">#29883</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4666434076\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44461\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44461/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44461\">mdn/content#44461</a></p>",
